hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19215","Yazid ibn Harun narrated to us, Abu al-Ashhab informed us from Abd al-Rahman ibn Tarafah that his grandfather Arfajah had his nose injured on the Day of al-Kulab in the Jahiliyyah, so he took a nose of silver, and it rotted on him. The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) ordered him to take a nose of gold. Yazid said: It was said to Abu al-Ashhab: Did you meet Abd al-Rahman, his grandfather? He said: Yes."
